---
description: Use API Guardian for AI SDK/API migration checks before changing provider integration code
alwaysApply: false
---

When working on OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, xAI/Grok, Mistral, or other supported AI SDK integrations:

- Start with `npx openai-api-guardian@latest . --scan --json`.
- Keep detection separate from migration. A detected provider is not automatically safe to rewrite.
- Prefer preview before apply.
- Review diffs and validation evidence before source changes.
- Never expose API keys or private source code.
- If CI should block on supported migration candidates, use `--scan --json --fail-on-candidates`.
- Do not claim support for flags or migrations absent from the installed release.
